#: kcmpolkitconfig.cpp:38
msgid "Global system policy settings"
msgstr "Globaal Systeemregeln instellen"

#: kcmpolkitconfig.cpp:39
msgid ""
"A configuration for polkit-1 system administrators and policy priorities"
msgstr "Systeempleger- un Regelprioriteten-Instellen för \"polkit-1\"."

#: kcmpolkitconfig.cpp:40
msgid "(c), 2009 Dario Freddi"
msgstr "© 2009: Dario Freddi"

#: kcmpolkitconfig.cpp:41
msgid ""
"From this module, you can configure system administrators and priorities for "
"the policies defined in the Actions module"
msgstr ""
"Mit dit Moduul laat sik Systeemplegers un Prioriteten för de Regeln ut dat "
"Akschonen-Moduul instellen."

#: kcmpolkitconfig.cpp:44
msgid "Dario Freddi"
msgstr "Dario Freddi"

#: kcmpolkitconfig.cpp:44
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Pleger"

#: kcmpolkitconfig.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The changes will have no effect, since another policy has an higher priority "
"(%1). Please change the priority of policies defined through this module to "
"an higher value."
msgstr ""
"De Ännern blifft ahn Utwarken, wiel en anner Regel en höger Prioriteet hett "
"(%1). Bitte stell en höger Weert för de Regelprioriteten in, de sik mit dit "
"Moduul fastleggen laat."

